# Read by ripgrep, and therefore by every agent that searches this repository.
#
# `repos/` is 3,558 files of vendored Effect source. Reading it deliberately is
# the whole point — `AGENTS.md` says to, before writing Effect code — but having
# it in the results of every unrelated search is noise that costs an agent
# context and attention on every single query.
#
# `rg --no-ignore` still reaches it, which is what a deliberate read looks like.
repos/
pnpm-lock.yaml
